                        "entry_id": "5ca025a8-6eeb-3919-8121-556d873bc5b0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The quality of being delectable."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "46133c84-e42f-4245-947f-21845680cfff",
                                "sense_id": "b8a87003-f55a-3ce2-bd8d-8709e6c138a9",
                                "text": "If I really wanted to take full advantage of their delectability, and to eat them every day, a plan was in order."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4ac8059e-ab5c-30a0-add1-3b69c1be4fa4",
                        "entry_id": "5ca025a8-6eeb-3919-8121-556d873bc5b0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A delight."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "55a60f1c-8350-4a46-acb6-37ccda561773",
                                "sense_id": "4ac8059e-ab5c-30a0-add1-3b69c1be4fa4",
                                "text": "I had heard of this court and its delectabilities, and at the same time been informed that its throne was a faro-table, to which the initiated were imperatively expected to become tributaries."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f7c885ac-7308-4881-ba56-98c4b811e7a6",
                                "sense_id": "4ac8059e-ab5c-30a0-add1-3b69c1be4fa4",
                                "text": "But we will look a little more closely at the delectabilities of these three volumes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d936e7dd-b1f5-41ad-b530-b5940d735c11",
                                "sense_id": "4ac8059e-ab5c-30a0-add1-3b69c1be4fa4",
                                "text": "With wine at hand, the good man concerns himself, not with getting drunk, but with drinking in all the natural delectabilities of wine: taste, color, bouquet; […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
